  "body": "Enjoy the comfort and convenience of this brand new, two-storey home at 217 West Hoe Heights, Orewa.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a crisp white exterior complemented by dark accents, this home presents a clean and contemporary architectural style.\r\n\r\nWith generously proportioned interiors, this three-bedroom home offers plenty of room to enjoy. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area benefits from good natural light, while high ceilings in selected areas add to the sense of openness.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout includes three bedrooms and three bathrooms, along with an internal access garage, dedicated laundry area and handy storage space under the stairs.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n- Three bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n- Approx. 150.44m² total floor area\r\n- Approx. 25.16m² balcony\r\n- Approx. 111.84m² outdoor living space\r\n- Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Internal access garage\r\n- Laundry area and under-stair storage\r\n- Brand new two-storey home\r\n\r\nConveniently located in the popular coastal community of Orewa, close to the beach, cafés, shops, parks and local amenities.\r\n\r\nA wonderful opportunity to secure a brand new home offering contemporary style, generous interiors and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
